{"hw":"πέντε","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">πέντε</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">πέντε</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Aeol.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">πέμπε</span> (q.v.), <span class=\"lex-gram\">οἱ</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">αἱ</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">τά</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">indecl.</span> (declined in <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Aeol.</span> </span>), <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">five</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">10.317</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">τὰ πέντε κρατήσας</span> having won the <span class=\"gk\">πένταθλον</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Simon.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">155.11</span> </span>. (I.-<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> </span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">penq[uglide]e</b>, cf. Skt. <b class=\"lex-tr\">páñca</b>, Lith. <b class=\"lex-tr\">penki</b>, etc. 'five'.)</div></div>"}